{"data":{"status":true,"competition":{"id":1758032,"visibility":"public","theme_colour":"blue-dark_un","paid":0,"title":"IPL - Innovation Pitch League","festival_id":null,"organization_id":1894919,"web_url":"iet-ipl-2026.vercel.app","start_date":"2026-09-19T00:00:00+05:30","end_date":"2026-10-19T13:00:00+05:30","location":null,"type":"competitions","public_url":"competitions\/ipl-innovation-pitch-league-iet-on-campus-sies-graduate-school-of-technology-navi-mumbai-maharashtra-1758032","region":"offline","details":"<p id=\"p-rc_aa0858ae5e2e3995-226\" data-path-to-node=\"3\"><span data-path-to-node=\"3,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">IPL &ndash; Innovation Pitch League<\/strong> is a two-day, sports-league-style competition where individual contenders qualify through aptitude and group discussions, get drafted into mentored squads via a live talent auction, and pitch practical solutions to an industry challenge<\/span><span data-path-to-node=\"3,2\">.<\/span><\/p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"4\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"4\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Eligibility &amp; Registration<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li><span data-path-to-node=\"5,2,0,0\">Registration Fee: \u20b9100 per participant<\/span><span data-path-to-node=\"5,2,0,2\">. <strong>To register, fill the Google Form and register on this page.<\/strong> The form includes payment details and requires you to upload a screenshot of your payment as confirmation.(<a href=\"https:\/\/forms.gle\/Ku84EXvjiFvU25us9\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Registration Form<\/strong><\/a>)<\/span><\/li>\n<li id=\"p-rc_aa0858ae5e2e3995-227\" data-path-to-node=\"5,0,0\"><span data-path-to-node=\"5,0,0,0\">Participation: Individual registration only (teams are formed through the auction stage)<\/span><span data-path-to-node=\"5,0,0,2\">.<\/span><\/li>\n<li id=\"p-rc_aa0858ae5e2e3995-228\" data-path-to-node=\"5,1,0\"><span data-path-to-node=\"5,1,0,0\">Capacity: Capped at the first 160 participants<\/span><span data-path-to-node=\"5,1,0,2\">.<\/span><\/li>\n<li id=\"p-rc_aa0858ae5e2e3995-230\" data-path-to-node=\"5,3,0\"><span data-path-to-node=\"5,3,0,0\">Venue: SIES Graduate School of Technology, Nerul<\/span><span data-path-to-node=\"5,3,0,2\">.<\/span><\/li>\n<li id=\"p-rc_aa0858ae5e2e3995-231\" data-path-to-node=\"5,4,0\"><span data-path-to-node=\"5,4,0,0\">Dates: 09th &amp; 10th October 2026<\/span><span data-path-to-node=\"5,4,0,2\">.<\/span><\/li>\n<li><span data-path-to-node=\"5,4,0,2\">Visit the website for detailed schedule and event flow: <a href=\"https:\/\/iet-ipl-2026.vercel.app\">IET - IPL Website&nbsp;<\/a><\/span><\/li>\n<li><span data-path-to-node=\"5,4,0,2\">Join the Whatsapp Group after registering on the Google Form: <a href=\"https:\/\/chat.whatsapp.com\/HRKZgkw0TFt213oX5NuKgu\">IPL Participants<\/a><\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Competition Format &amp; Stages<\/strong><\/p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7,0,0\">Round 1: Aptitude &amp; Group Discussion (Day 1)<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li id=\"p-rc_aa0858ae5e2e3995-232\" data-path-to-node=\"7,0,1,0,0\"><span data-path-to-node=\"7,0,1,0,0,0\">Aptitude covers Quantitative Aptitude, Logical Reasoning, Analytical Thinking, Problem Solving, Technical Fundamentals, and DSA<\/span><span data-path-to-node=\"7,0,1,0,0,2\">.<\/span><\/li>\n<li id=\"p-rc_aa0858ae5e2e3995-233\" data-path-to-node=\"7,0,1,1,0\"><span data-path-to-node=\"7,0,1,1,0,0\">Group Discussion evaluated by external judges for communication, leadership, and critical thinking<\/span><span data-path-to-node=\"7,0,1,1,0,2\">.<\/span><\/li>\n<li id=\"p-rc_aa0858ae5e2e3995-234\" data-path-to-node=\"7,0,1,2,0\"><span data-path-to-node=\"7,0,1,2,0,0\">Combined scores determine the top 48 qualifiers<\/span><span data-path-to-node=\"7,0,1,2,0,2\">.<br \/><\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7,1,0\">Stage 2: Captain Selection &amp; Talent Auction (Day 1)<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li id=\"p-rc_aa0858ae5e2e3995-235\" data-path-to-node=\"7,1,1,0,0\"><span data-path-to-node=\"7,1,1,0,0,0\">The top 8 qualifiers are designated as Team Captains<\/span><span data-path-to-node=\"7,1,1,0,0,2\">.<\/span><\/li>\n<li id=\"p-rc_aa0858ae5e2e3995-236\" data-path-to-node=\"7,1,1,1,0\"><span data-path-to-node=\"7,1,1,1,0,0\">Captains bid on the remaining 40 candidates in a live talent auction to form 8 teams<\/span><span data-path-to-node=\"7,1,1,1,0,2\">.<\/span><\/li>\n<li id=\"p-rc_aa0858ae5e2e3995-237\" data-path-to-node=\"7,1,1,2,0\"><span data-path-to-node=\"7,1,1,2,0,0\">Squad structure: 6 members per team (1 Captain + 5 participants) paired with an alumni mentor<\/span><span data-path-to-node=\"7,1,1,2,0,2\">.<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7,2,0\">Stage 3: Innovation Challenge (Day 2)<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li id=\"p-rc_aa0858ae5e2e3995-238\" data-path-to-node=\"7,2,1,0,0\"><span data-path-to-node=\"7,2,1,0,0,0\">Teams work on an industry-oriented problem statement with dedicated mentor guidance to develop a feasible, impactful solution<\/span><span data-path-to-node=\"7,2,1,0,0,2\">.<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7,3,0\">Stage 4: Final Pitch &amp; Evaluation (Day 2)<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li data-path-to-node=\"7,3,0\"><span data-path-to-node=\"7,3,1,0,0,0\">Format: 7-minute pitch presentation followed by a 3-minute jury Q&amp;A (7 + 3)<\/span><span data-path-to-node=\"7,3,1,0,0,2\">.<\/span><\/li>\n<li><span data-path-to-node=\"7,3,1,1,0,0\">Evaluated directly by industry professionals and judges<\/span><span data-path-to-node=\"7,3,1,1,0,2\"><br \/><\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Rules &amp; Guidelines<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li id=\"p-rc_aa0858ae5e2e3995-241\" data-path-to-node=\"9,0,0\"><span data-path-to-node=\"9,0,0,0\">All participants must register individually; external pre-formed teams are not permitted<\/span><span data-path-to-node=\"9,0,0,2\">.<\/span><\/li>\n<li id=\"p-rc_aa0858ae5e2e3995-242\" data-path-to-node=\"9,1,0\"><span data-path-to-node=\"9,1,0,0\">Advancement to the auction and Day 2 challenge is strictly merit-based, restricted to the top 48 combined scorers<\/span><span data-path-to-node=\"9,1,0,2\">.<\/span><\/li>\n<li id=\"p-rc_aa0858ae5e2e3995-243\" data-path-to-node=\"9,2,0\"><span data-path-to-node=\"9,2,0,0\">Both days require mandatory on-campus participation.<\/span><\/li>\n<li><strong>Lunch will be provided on the first day, and snacks and refreshments will be provided on the second day<\/strong><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"10\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"10\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Rewards &amp; Opportunities<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li><span data-path-to-node=\"11,0,0,0\">Winner: \u20b915,000<\/span><\/li>\n<li><span data-path-to-node=\"11,1,0,0\">Runner-Up: \u20b910,000<\/span><\/li>\n<li><span data-path-to-node=\"11,2,0,0\">Second Runner-Up: \u20b95,000<\/span><\/li>\n<li><span data-path-to-node=\"11,3,0,0\">Deserving performers may also be considered for exclusive internship opportunities offered at the discretion of industry judges<\/span><span data-path-to-node=\"11,3,0,2\">.<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>Contacts:<\/strong><\/p>\n<p><span data-path-to-node=\"11,3,0,0\">Gaurav: 8850439707<br \/>Ovee: 8850544242<br \/>Sudhanshu: 9325959412<br \/>Taazeen: 8591524096<\/span><\/p>","overall_prizes":null,"regn_open":1,"regn_type":1,"regn_url":null,"regn_email":"","registration_clicks":0,"user_id":30558572,"moderation_status":1,"overall_leaderboard":0,"reject_reason":null,"display_date":null,"created_at":"2026-09-18T17:01:40+05:30","updated_at":"2026-10-04T19:05:17+05:30","communication_sent":null,"certificate_at":null,"remarks":null,"branding":0,"disable_auto_rounds":null,"certificate_config":null,"subtype":"innovation_challenge","combined_leaderboard":null,"source":null,"short_id":"nhaBf8o","hashtags":null,"participation_certificate":1,"winner_certificate_at":null,"listed":1,